#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `removes criminal property from England and Wales or from Scotland or from Northern Ireland` `an account act below the threshold`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `an account act at the threshold`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `an account act above the threshold`
#ASSERT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `an account act below a higher threshold specified under section 339A(3)`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `an account act by a body that is not a deposit-taking body`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `an act that is not in operating an account`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2C) the exception for acts in operating an account applies` `converts criminal property` `no account facts`
-- (2D)
#ASSERT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `converts criminal property` `a termination transfer below the threshold`
#ASSERT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `transfers criminal property` `a termination transfer below the threshold`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `conceals criminal property` `a termination transfer below the threshold`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `converts criminal property` `a termination transfer at the threshold`
