#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `converts criminal property` `a handing over that is not to the customer`
#ASSERT NOT `s 327(2D) the exception for acts that end a business relationship applies` `converts criminal property` `no termination facts`
-- (2F): the acts in paragraphs (c), (d) and (e); the value after the act must not be less than the value of the criminal part
#ASSERT `s 327(2F) the exception for mixed funds applies` `converts criminal property` `mixed funds kept whole`
#ASSERT `s 327(2F) the exception for mixed funds applies` `transfers criminal property` `mixed funds kept whole`
