#ASSERT `s 327(2G) the funds or property immediately after the act are assumed to include the relevant criminal property` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 327(2G) the funds or property immediately after the act are assumed to include the relevant criminal property` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
