§ `s 327(1) the offence`
-- arguments: the s 340(3) answer, the act, disclosure facts, overseas facts, account facts, termination facts, mixed funds facts
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `disguises criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `converts criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `transfers criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `removes criminal property from England and Wales or from Scotland or from Northern Ireland` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an act the subsection does not list
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `another act` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- property that is not criminal property for him; and a status the text leaves open
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST FALSE) `conceals criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` NOTHING `conceals criminal property` `no exemption facts` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS NOTHING
-- an exception answers JUST FALSE even when the property's status is open
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` NOTHING `conceals criminal property` `an authorised disclosure after the act` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2)(a) to (c)
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `an authorised disclosure after the act` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
