#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `an authorised disclosure before the act without consent` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `an intended disclosure with a reasonable excuse` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `an intended disclosure without a reasonable excuse` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `an enforcement function` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- adequate consideration is not a defence to section 327
#ASSERT `s 327(1) the person commits an offence` (JUST TRUE) `conceals criminal property` `adequate consideration` `no overseas facts` `no account facts` `no termination facts` `no mixed funds facts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (2A)
